The word is "ABAB".
The limit is 2.
Keep a shared ordered as empty text.
Keep a shared streak as 0.
Keep a shared bestrun as 0.
To score from spot (a whole number) with last (a whole number).
If spot is more than last, return.
If character spot of ordered is character (spot minus 1) of ordered, add 1 to streak.
If character spot of ordered is not character (spot minus 1) of ordered, set streak to 1.
If streak is more than bestrun, set bestrun to streak.
Score from spot plus 1 with last.

The last is the last position of word.
The best is 1.
For every start from 0 to last.
For every finish from start to last.
The endpoint is finish plus 1.
The piece is the slice of word from start to endpoint.
Set ordered to sort characters of piece.
The lastletter is the last position of ordered.
Set streak to 1.
Set bestrun to 1.
Score from 1 with lastletter.
The span is finish minus start plus 1.
If span minus bestrun is at most limit and span is more than best, set best to span.

Show best.
